          "id": "STORYBOARD-SOURCE-BINDING-P2-PROVIDER-BUDGET",
          "severity": "P2",
          "verdict": "ACCEPT",
          "boundary": "provider request admission, quota, inflight and lease cleanup",
          "counterexample": "apps/web/lib/admin/storyboard/gemini-client.ts dynamically imports backend/utils/provider-budget.mjs for every model catalog and generation call. That wrapper executes backend.utils.provider_budget as a Python subprocess. Neither first-party runtime file is present in STORYBOARD_RUNTIME_SOURCE_PATHS, so changes to provider admission or lease semantics leave the storyboard source and canonical policy digests unchanged.",
